  DialogText:
  - To open the menu click esc.
  - 'Then click inventory to see all the items you have. You can press escape again
    to back out.   '
  - 'It will show you what can be equipped in that slot. Click on the item to do
    so. If you want to unequip it just click the slot and press unequip.  '
  - 'Click on the labeled buttons at the top to switch party members you are looking
    at.  '
